  "bio": [
    "Wang Laichun, also known as Grace Wang, is the chairman and general manager of electronics component manufacturer Luxshare Precision Industry.",
    "One of the company's most important customers is Apple. CEO Tim Cook has visited its China factories often.",
    "Wang worked for Taiwanese billionaire Terry Gou's Hon Hai Precision Industry (also known as Foxconn) for 10 years.",
    "Wang left in 1997 and teamed up with her brother Wang Laisheng to set up Luxshare in 2004; he is now the vice chairman.",
    "Luxshare went public on the Shenzhen Stock Exchange in 2010. It had a dual listing in Hong Kong in July 2026."
